  "body": "Positioned in a highly sought-after Long Bay neighborhood, this exceptional new residence seamlessly blends modern contemporary design with a relaxed coastal lifestyle. Designed with generous proportions and continuous flow, the layout ensures effortless family connection while preserving private sanctuaries, making it ideal for quality modern family living and multi-generational families alike.\r\n\r\nThe ground level welcomes you with a covered porch leading into a high-ceilinged entry hall. At the center of the home, the open-plan living and dining domain creates an inviting setting for family gatherings. The main kitchen is complemented by a functional walk-in scullery for discreet preparation and additional storage. Expansive glass sliding doors extend the living space outward to a wooden deck and a fully fenced backyard, offering a versatile area for alfresco dining, summer entertaining, or outdoor relaxation. This level also features a private master suite complete with its own ensuite—ideal for guests or extended family—alongside a separate formal lounge, a guest powder room, and a double internal-access garage.\r\n\r\nThe upper level is designed for personal privacy and comfort, housing four spacious master suites that each feature a dedicated ensuite and a walk-in wardrobe. A central family lounge complete with a built-in bar area creates a second versatile living domain, perfect for evening entertainment, film nights, or a quiet retreat.\r\n\r\nConstructed with natural cedar cladding and double-glazed windows throughout, the home combines classic materials with low-maintenance living. Situated within easy reach of Long Bay Beach, Long Bay Regional Park, vibrant local village shops, dining options, and public transport connections, this property provides a refined balance of coastal convenience and everyday comfort. CALL TODAY!",
